            <description><![CDATA[<h2>GraphClick 3.1.1</h2>
<p>This release restores compatibility with older GraphClick documents.</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Opens documents from GraphClick 3.0.x and earlier again.</strong>
        Files saved by older versions use the original document format, which
        3.1 could no longer read &mdash; they failed with &ldquo;The file
        isn&rsquo;t in the correct format.&rdquo; Those documents now open
        normally.</li>
    <li>Opening such a document and saving it upgrades it to the current format.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
